# Lucky Shop Analytics Dashboard

Financial analytics and daily lixi projection dashboard for Lucky Shop.

## Synchronization Workflow

To ensure your changes are synchronized between this environment and your GitHub repository:

### 1. Synchronizing with GitHub (AI Studio Platform)
The easiest way to sync is using the built-in integration:
- Open the **Settings** menu (gear icon) in the top-right corner.
- Select **Export to GitHub**.
- Connect your GitHub account and select your repository: `vinhngtienmdb-ui/lucky-shop-dashboard`.
- This will open a PR or commit directly to your main branch.

### 2. Manual Git (Advanced)
If you are working locally and want to pull these changes:
- Commit and push from AI Studio via the "Export to GitHub" flow.
- On your local machine, run:
  ```bash
  git pull origin main
  ```

### 3. Firebase Synchronization
- The app is connected to the project ID `vcomm-erp-prod` (AI Studio default).
- If you need to use `luckyshopAnalytics` specifically, ensure you have set up the secrets and permissions correctly in the AI Studio Secrets panel.
